==Trivia==
*The gamemode [[Disguises]] was the original gamemode for Murder Mystery 2 until Casual Mode came out on December 23, 2015. It's much more similar to the Garry's Mod gamemode "Murder", which the original game was based on.
*Casual Mode was created due to popular demand, Nikilis however didn't like the mode at all.<ref>https://www.reddit.com/r/MurderMystery2/comments/3y3v0s/please_read_casual_mode/</ref>
*The game has 29.5B visits, 23.6M favorites, and 10M likes as of August 23, 2026.
*Murder Mystery 2's genre is Survival, While it's subgenre is 1 vs All.
*Murder Mystery 2 from March 2017 - August 2017 was the most visited game on Roblox.
*Murder Mystery 2 reached it's first 1M concurrect players on the release day of [[Summer Event 2026]].

